COMPND   7 AMPA 2,GLUA2;                                                        
COMPND   8 ENGINEERED: YES;                                                     
COMPND   9 OTHER_DETAILS: NATIVE GLUA2 IS A MEMBRANE PROTEIN. THE CRYSTALLIZED  
COMPND  10 PROTEIN IS A N775S-MUTANT OF THE GLUA2 LIGAND-BINDING DOMAIN. THE    
COMPND  11 SEQUENCE MATCHES DISCONTINUOUSLY WITH REFERENCE DATABASE (413-527,   
COMPND  12 653-797). TRANSMEMBRANE REGIONS ARE REPLACED WITH A GLY-THR LINKER   
COMPND  13 (RESIDUES 118-119) AND GLY1-ALA2 IS CLONING REMNANT.                 
